NAME
    arch - print the architecture of the running command

SYNOPSIS
    arch

DESCRIPTION
    Print i386 for the ELF32 build or x86_64 for the ELF64 build.
    The x86_64 kernel can run ELF32 commands in compatibility mode.
    Use sysctl hw.machine to query the kernel architecture.

EXIT STATUS
    The arch utility exits 0 on success.
